{"id":"9fa7db79fea5f29a","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics.md","title":"Deterministic Multitape Turing Machine","display":"df-multitape-turing-machine — Deterministic Multitape Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics","aliases":["73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics","73-df-multitape-turing-machine"],"display":"df-multitape-turing-machine — Deterministic Multitape Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","[[73-df-dtm-local-transition]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</span><span>73-df-multitape-turing-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-multitape-turing-machine — Deterministic Multitape Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"51696a3513b66fda\" href=\"?note=51696a3513b66fda\" title=\"73-df-dtm-local-transition\">73-df-dtm-local-transition</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (input alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (number of tapes)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(\\mathsf L)=-1\">\\(d(\\mathsf L)=-1\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(\\mathsf R)=1\">\\(d(\\mathsf R)=1\\)</span> (head displacements, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51696a3513b66fda\" href=\"?note=51696a3513b66fda\" title=\"73-df-dtm-local-transition\">73-df-dtm-local-transition</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RTC}\">\\(\\operatorname{RTC}\\)</span> (reflexive transitive closure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在配置、转移及语言子句中，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\)</span>；这里各分量是该固定元组的唯一投影，不沿用前一个存在量词的局部变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 的结构子句以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选对象，不预先假设该结构谓词；其余子句才固定上面给出的有效机器。一步关系的两个参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MConf}_{M}\">\\(\\operatorname{MConf}_{M}\\)</span> 中的配置。所有带编号属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\">\\(\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\)</span>，运行长度属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land 0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\n\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\n\\land q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\in Q\n\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land 0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\n\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\n\\land q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\in Q\n\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in Q\\times(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\times\\mathbb Z^k:\n\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\n|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))(i)\\neq\\mathrm{blank}\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in Q\\times(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\times\\mathbb Z^k:\n\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\n|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))(i)\\neq\\mathrm{blank}\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\to_M(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl((q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\land(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\bigr)\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\n\\land\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\Gamma^k\\,\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\\;\n\\left[\n\\bigl((q,\\langle(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))(\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)):1\\le j\\le k\\rangle),(q&#39;,\\mathbf a,\\mathbf D)\\bigr)\\in\\delta\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\bigl(1\\leq j\\leq k\\to\n(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T&#39;)=(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))[\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)\\mapsto \\pi_j(\\mathbf a)]\\land \\pi_j(\\mathbf h&#39;)=\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)+d(\\pi_j(\\mathbf D)))\\bigr)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\to_M(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl((q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\land(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\bigr)\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\n\\land\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\Gamma^k\\,\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\\;\n\\left[\n\\bigl((q,\\langle(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))(\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)):1\\le j\\le k\\rangle),(q&#39;,\\mathbf a,\\mathbf D)\\bigr)\\in\\delta\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\bigl(1\\leq j\\leq k\\to\n(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T&#39;)=(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))[\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)\\mapsto \\pi_j(\\mathbf a)]\\land \\pi_j(\\mathbf h&#39;)=\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)+d(\\pi_j(\\mathbf D)))\\bigr)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nR_M\\coloneqq\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\times\\operatorname{MConf}_M:C\\to_M C&#39;\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nR_M\\coloneqq\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\times\\operatorname{MConf}_M:C\\to_M C&#39;\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nT_w(i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}w(i),&amp;0\\leq i&lt;|w|,\\\\ \\mathrm{blank},&amp;i&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le i,\\end{cases}\n\\quad T_{\\mathrm{blank}}(i)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{blank},\\quad\nC_M^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(q_0,\\langle T_w\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle T_{\\mathrm{blank}}:2\\le j\\le k\\rangle,\\langle 0:1\\le j\\le k\\rangle\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nT_w(i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}w(i),&amp;0\\leq i&lt;|w|,\\\\ \\mathrm{blank},&amp;i&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le i,\\end{cases}\n\\quad T_{\\mathrm{blank}}(i)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{blank},\\quad\nC_M^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(q_0,\\langle T_w\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle T_{\\mathrm{blank}}:2\\le j\\le k\\rangle,\\langle 0:1\\le j\\le k\\rangle\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\n\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\,\\exists\\mathbf T\\,\\exists\\mathbf h\\;\n\\bigl(C_M^{\\mathsf{in}}(w),C\\bigr)\\in\n\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{MConf}_M}(R_M)\n\\land C=(q_{\\mathsf{acc}},\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\n\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\,\\exists\\mathbf T\\,\\exists\\mathbf h\\;\n\\bigl(C_M^{\\mathsf{in}}(w),C\\bigr)\\in\n\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{MConf}_M}(R_M)\n\\land C=(q_{\\mathsf{acc}},\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_M^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\">\\(C_M^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\\)</span>, tape <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> contains <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> from cell <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>, all other cells are blank, and every head starts at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The displayed step applies the transition to all scanned symbols and updates every tape and head simultaneously.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]